					"text" : "UNIT TESTS\n\nThe run-tests message runs all unit tests and is only available if md is compiled with CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=UNIT.\n\nFor the UNIT build, md grows a second outlet on the left, and the coll wll be connected through add-unit-results-or-query-results-to-coll to that outlet.  To capture query results from maxcounts when build type is UNIT, you'll have to rewire the coll to the right outlet.\n\nDetailed results of run-test print to the console, and the final run of each test should appear in the coll:\n\npd_td_fill_shift, 16 0;\rtranslate_bits, 16 0;\rfind_repeats_register, 4 5 0 1;\rmd_float_order, 16 5 64 0;\rperf_last_note, 16 27.515125 2.030916 4557 1127 22.612834 22.398542 19.535 19.15709;\rperf_bach, 16 2.335916 0.285083 335 3036 1.747458 1.674833 3.15875 2.53042;\r"
